    "module": "函数与作用域",
    "what": "普通函数this由调用方式决定；箭头继承外层this。call/apply立即调用，bind返回新函数且可预置参数。",
    "subtitle": "普通函数this由调用方式决定；箭头继承外层this。",
    "html": "<section class=\"lesson-demo\">\n  <h2>普通函数、箭头函数与 call/apply/bind</h2>\n  <p>修改代码并运行，对比输出。</p>\n  <pre id=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\"></pre>\n</section>",
    "css": "",
    "js": "const output = document.querySelector('#result');\nfunction print(...values) {\n  const text = values\n    .map((value) =>\n      typeof value === 'object' ? JSON.stringify(value, null, 2) : String(value),\n    )\n    .join(' ');\n  output.textContent += text + '\\n';\n  console.log(...values);\n}\nfunction introduce(prefix, suffix) {\n  return prefix + this.name + suffix;\n}\nconst user = { name: '小雨' };\nprint(introduce.call(user, '你好，', '！'));\nprint(introduce.apply(user, ['欢迎，', '。']));\nconst bound = introduce.bind(user, '绑定参数：');\nprint(bound('完成'));\nconst group = {\n  name: '实验室',\n  read() {\n    const arrow = () => this.name;\n    return arrow.call({ name: '其他' });\n  },\n};\nprint('箭头this：', group.read());\nfunction strictThis() {\n  'use strict';\n  return this;\n}\nprint('严格裸调用：', strictThis());",
