    "subtitle": "赋值共享整个对象，浅复制创建新顶层但共享嵌套引用。",
    "html": "<section class=\"lesson-demo\">\n  <h2>浅复制、深复制与 structuredClone</h2>\n  <p>修改代码并运行，对比输出。</p>\n  <pre id=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\"></pre>\n</section>",
    "css": "",
    "js": "const output = document.querySelector('#result');\nfunction print(...values) {\n  const text = values\n    .map((value) =>\n      typeof value === 'object' ? JSON.stringify(value, null, 2) : String(value),\n    )\n    .join(' ');\n  output.textContent += text + '\\n';\n  console.log(...values);\n}\nconst source = { name: '原值', nested: { count: 1 }, date: new Date('2024-01-01') };\nconst shallow = { ...source };\nshallow.name = '独立顶层';\nshallow.nested.count = 2;\nprint('共享嵌套：', source.nested.count);\nconst deep = structuredClone(source);\ndeep.nested.count = 9;\nprint('未影响原值：', source.nested.count, 'Date：', deep.date instanceof Date);\nconst cyclic = {};\ncyclic.self = cyclic;\nconst cloned = structuredClone(cyclic);\nprint('循环关系：', cloned.self === cloned);",
