    "html": "<section class=\"lesson-demo\">\n  <h2>throw、try/catch/finally 与零值验证</h2>\n  <p>修改代码并运行，对比输出。</p>\n  <pre id=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\"></pre>\n</section>",
    "css": "",
    "js": "const output = document.querySelector('#result');\nfunction print(...values) {\n  const text = values\n    .map((value) =>\n      typeof value === 'object' ? JSON.stringify(value, null, 2) : String(value),\n    )\n    .join(' ');\n  output.textContent += text + '\\n';\n  console.log(...values);\n}\nfunction sum(a, b) {\n  if (!Number.isFinite(a) || !Number.isFinite(b)) throw new TypeError('需要有限数字');\n  return a + b;\n}\nfor (const pair of [\n  [0, 5],\n  [undefined, 2],\n]) {\n  try {\n    print('结果：', sum(...pair));\n  } catch (error) {\n    print(error.name + '：' + error.message);\n  } finally {\n    print('该次校验结束');\n  }\n}",
    "observe": [
      "0和5合法",
      "无效输入被catch",
      "finally每次执行"
    ],
    "challenge": "增加除法并处理除数0。",
    "pitfalls": [
      "catch不应静默吞错；finally中的return可能覆盖原结果。"
    ],
