    "cat": "js",
    "id": "manual-atm",
    "title": "ATM 状态：存入、取出与校验",
    "module": "组件交互拆解",
    "what": "把循环式prompt题改成事件驱动：表单收集金额，动作函数验证后更新余额，错误不改变已有状态。",
    "subtitle": "把循环式prompt题改成事件驱动：表单收集金额，动作函数验证后更新余额，错误不改变已有状态。",
    "html": "<section class=\"lesson-demo\">\n  <h2>ATM 状态：存入、取出与校验</h2>\n  <p>\n    余额：\n    <strong id=\"balance\">100.00</strong>\n    元\n  </p>\n  <label>\n    金额\n    <input id=\"amount\" type=\"number\" min=\"0.01\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"20\" />\n  </label>\n  <button id=\"deposit\">存入</button>\n  <button id=\"withdraw\">取出</button>\n  <p id=\"message\" role=\"status\"></p>\n</section>",
    "css": "",
    "js": "let balance = 10000;\nfunction change(direction) {\n  const value = document.querySelector('#amount').value;\n  const cents = Math.round(Number(value) * 100);\n  const message = document.querySelector('#message');\n  if (!value.trim() || !Number.isSafeInteger(cents) || cents <= 0) {\n    message.textContent = '请输入有效的正金额';\n    return;\n  }\n  if (direction === -1 && cents > balance) {\n    message.textContent = '余额不足';\n    return;\n  }\n  balance += direction * cents;\n  document.querySelector('#balance').textContent = (balance / 100).toFixed(2);\n  message.textContent = direction === 1 ? '存入成功' : '取出成功';\n}\ndocument.querySelector('#deposit').onclick = () => change(1);\ndocument.querySelector('#withdraw').onclick = () => change(-1);",
    "observe": [
      "余额以整数分保存",
      "取款超过余额会拒绝",
      "输入空值不会改变余额"
    ],
    "challenge": "增加交易记录数组并渲染成列表。",
