    "id": "manual-marquee",
    "title": "无缝走马灯：重复轨道与暂停",
    "module": "变换与动画",
    "what": "将同一组装饰内容复制一次，轨道平移半个总宽度后重置，形成循环。真实重要内容不应只能随动画读取。",
    "subtitle": "将同一组装饰内容复制一次，轨道平移半个总宽度后重置，形成循环。",
    "html": "<section class=\"lesson-demo\">\n  <h2>无缝走马灯：重复轨道与暂停</h2>\n  <div class=\"marquee\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"课程关键词展示\">\n    <div class=\"marquee-track\">\n      <div>HTML　CSS　JavaScript　布局　交互　</div>\n      <div aria-hidden=\"true\">HTML　CSS　JavaScript　布局　交互　</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
    "css": ".marquee {\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #deede2;\n}\n.marquee-track {\n  display: flex;\n  width: max-content;\n  animation: marquee 12s linear infinite;\n}\n.marquee-track > div {\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  padding: 20px;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n.marquee:hover .marquee-track,\n.marquee:focus-within .marquee-track {\n  animation-play-state: paused;\n}\n@keyframes marquee {\n  to {\n    transform: translateX(-50%);\n  }\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .marquee-track {\n    animation: none;\n  }\n}",
    "js": "",
