    "id": "manual-favorite-state",
    "title": "收藏切换：布尔状态与可访问反馈",
    "module": "组件交互拆解",
    "what": "活动卡片和个人收藏页面可共享一个布尔状态。按钮aria-pressed和可见文字同步更新，纯前端练习不需要登录。",
    "subtitle": "活动卡片和个人收藏页面可共享一个布尔状态。",
    "html": "<section class=\"lesson-demo\">\n  <h2>收藏切换：布尔状态与可访问反馈</h2>\n  <article>\n    <h3>周末布局练习</h3>\n    <p>把活动卡片拆成封面、状态标签、收藏按钮和详情。</p>\n    <button id=\"favorite\" aria-pressed=\"false\">☆ 收藏</button>\n    <p id=\"feedback\" role=\"status\">尚未收藏</p>\n  </article>\n</section>",
    "css": "",
    "js": "let saved = false;\nconst button = document.querySelector('#favorite');\nbutton.onclick = () => {\n  saved = !saved;\n  button.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(saved));\n  button.textContent = saved ? '★ 已收藏' : '☆ 收藏';\n  document.querySelector('#feedback').textContent = saved\n    ? '已加入当前预览的收藏'\n    : '已取消收藏';\n};",
